<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>LUMINA | About Us</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --golden-glow: #FBC867;
            --soft-peach: #FCA994;
            --rich-ebony: #250B06;
            --rose-brick: #C25D61;
            --vibrant-ember: #ED760B;
            --spacing-xl: 6rem;
            --spacing-lg: 4rem;
            --spacing-md: 2rem;
            --spacing-sm: 1rem;
            --border-radius: 12px;
            --transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.9, 0.4, 1.1);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--rich-ebony);
            color: #FFFFFF;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            line-height: 1.6;
            /* padding-top: 100px; */
        }

        h1, h2, h3, h4 {
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 2rem;
        }

        /* Page Header */
        .page-header.editable-section[data-section="135"] {
            text-align: center;
            padding: var(--spacing-lg) 0 var(--spacing-md);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
        }

        h1.about-title.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="136"] {
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: var(--golden-glow);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        h1.about-title.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="136"]::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -10px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 100px;
            height: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--golden-glow), var(--soft-peach));
        }

        .about-subtitle.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="137"] {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
            font-size: 1rem;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero-about.editable-section[data-section="138"] {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: var(--spacing-lg);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
            align-items: center;
        }

        .hero-image {
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            overflow: hidden;
            height: 500px;
            width: 100%;
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
        }

        .hero-content {
            padding: var(--spacing-md);
        }

        .hero-content h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="139"] {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            color: var(--golden-glow);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .hero-content p.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="140"] {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .highlight-text.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="141"] {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-style: italic;
            color: var(--soft-peach);
            border-left: 3px solid var(--golden-glow);
            padding-left: var(--spacing-sm);
            margin: var(--spacing-md) 0;
        }

        /* Mission & Values Section */
        .mission-values.editable-section[data-section="142"] {
            background: rgba(37, 11, 6, 0.75);
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            padding: var(--spacing-lg);
            border: 1px solid rgba(252, 169, 148, 0.2);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
        }

        .mission-values h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="143"] {
            font-size: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
            color: var(--golden-glow);
        }

        .values-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: var(--spacing-lg);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
        }

        .value-item {
            text-align: center;
            padding: var(--spacing-md);
        }

        .value-icon {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: var(--golden-glow);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
        }

        .value-title.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="144"] {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: var(--soft-peach);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
        }

        .value-description.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="145"] {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .mission-statement {
            text-align: center;
            padding: var(--spacing-lg);
            background: rgba(252, 169, 148, 0.05);
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);
        }

        .mission-statement h3.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="146"] {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: var(--golden-glow);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
        }

        .mission-statement p.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="147"] {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Craftsmanship Section */
        .craftsmanship.editable-section[data-section="148"] {
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
        }

        .craftsmanship h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="149"] {
            font-size: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
            color: var(--golden-glow);
        }

        .craftsmanship-content {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: var(--spacing-lg);
            align-items: center;
        }

        .craftsmanship-image {
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            overflow: hidden;
            height: 450px;
            width: 100%;
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
        }

        .craftsmanship-text {
            padding: var(--spacing-md);
        }

        .craftsmanship-text h3.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="150"] {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            color: var(--golden-glow);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
        }

        .craftsmanship-text p.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="151"] {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
        }

        .craftsmanship-stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: var(--spacing-sm);
            margin-top: var(--spacing-md);
        }

        .stat-item {
            text-align: center;
            padding: var(--spacing-sm);
            background: rgba(252, 169, 148, 0.05);
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
        }

        .stat-number.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="152"] {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            color: var(--golden-glow);
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        }

        .stat-label.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="153"] {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        /* Our Story Timeline */
        .story-timeline.editable-section[data-section="154"] {
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
        }

        .story-timeline h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="155"] {
            font-size: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
            color: var(--golden-glow);
        }

        .timeline {
            position: relative;
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .timeline::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 2px;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--golden-glow), var(--soft-peach));
        }

        .timeline-item {
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
            position: relative;
            width: 45%;
        }

        .timeline-item:nth-child(odd) {
            margin-left: 0;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        .timeline-item:nth-child(even) {
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: 0;
        }

        .timeline-content {
            background: rgba(37, 11, 6, 0.75);
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            padding: var(--spacing-md);
            border: 1px solid rgba(252, 169, 148, 0.2);
            position: relative;
        }

        .timeline-year.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="156"] {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            color: var(--golden-glow);
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .timeline-title.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="157"] {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: var(--soft-peach);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
        }

        .timeline-description.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="158"] {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .timeline-item::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            background: var(--golden-glow);
            border-radius: 50%;
            top: 20px;
        }

        .timeline-item:nth-child(odd)::before {
            right: -48px;
        }

        .timeline-item:nth-child(even)::before {
            left: -48px;
        }

        /* Team Section */
        .team-section.editable-section[data-section="159"] {
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
        }

        .team-section h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="160"] {
            font-size: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
            color: var(--golden-glow);
        }

        .team-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .team-member {
            background: rgba(37, 11, 6, 0.75);
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: var(--transition);
            border: 1px solid rgba(252, 169, 148, 0.2);
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }

        .team-member:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: var(--golden-glow);
        }

        .team-member-image {
            width: 150px;
            height: 150px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin: 0 auto var(--spacing-sm);
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
        }

        .team-member-name.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="161"] {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: var(--golden-glow);
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        }

        .team-member-role.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="162"] {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--soft-peach);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
        }

        .team-member-bio.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="163"] {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Commitment Section */
        .commitment.editable-section[data-section="164"] {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(37, 11, 6, 0.95), rgba(37, 11, 6, 0.85));
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            padding: var(--spacing-xl);
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
            border: 1px solid rgba(252, 169, 148, 0.2);
        }

        .commitment h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="165"] {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
            color: var(--golden-glow);
        }

        .commitment p.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="166"] {
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto var(--spacing-lg);
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
        }

        .commitment-stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: var(--spacing-md);
            margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);
        }

        .commitment-stat {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .commitment-number.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="167"] {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            color: var(--golden-glow);
        }

        .commitment-label.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="168"] {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 1200px) {
            .team-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 992px) {
            .hero-about,
            .craftsmanship-content {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .hero-image,
            .craftsmanship-image {
                height: 400px;
                order: -1;
            }
            .team-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
            .values-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
            .commitment-stats {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
            .timeline::before {
                left: 30px;
            }
            .timeline-item {
                width: calc(100% - 60px);
                margin-left: 60px !important;
                margin-right: 0 !important;
            }
            .timeline-item:nth-child(odd)::before,
            .timeline-item:nth-child(even)::before {
                left: -38px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            body {
                padding-top: 80px;
            }
            .team-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                max-width: 350px;
                margin: 0 auto;
            }
            .values-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .commitment-stats {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            h1.about-title.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="136"] {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }
            .hero-content h2 {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 576px) {
            h1.about-title.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="136"] {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
            .hero-image,
            .craftsmanship-image {
                height: 300px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Page Header -->
    <div class="page-header editable-section" data-section="135">
        <div class="container">
            <h1 class="about-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="136" data-text="105">Our Story</h1>
            <p class="about-subtitle editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="137" data-text="106">Crafting light that transforms spaces and elevates everyday moments since 2010</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <div class="hero-about editable-section" data-section="138">
            <div class="hero-image" style="background-image: url('https://images.pexels.com/photos/2079249/pexels-photo-2079249.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800')"></div>
            <div class="hero-content">
                <h2 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="139" data-text="107">Illuminating Spaces Since 2010</h2>
                <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="140" data-text="108">LUMINA was born from a simple belief: that light is not just functional—it's transformative. Founded by architect Elena Vasquez, our journey began in a small Brooklyn studio with a mission to create lighting that marries form and function, artistry and engineering.</p>
                <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="141" data-text="109">What started as a passion project quickly grew into a movement, attracting designers, architects, and homeowners who sought something beyond the ordinary. Today, LUMINA stands as a beacon of thoughtful design, with our fixtures illuminating homes, restaurants, galleries, and hotels across the globe.</p>
                <div class="highlight-text editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="142" data-text="110">"Light is the soul of architecture. It reveals form, creates mood, and transforms ordinary spaces into extraordinary experiences." — Elena Vasquez, Founder</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Mission & Values Section -->
        <div class="mission-values editable-section" data-section="143">
            <h2 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="144" data-text="111">Our Philosophy</h2>
            <div class="values-grid">
                <div class="value-item">
                    <div class="value-icon"><i class="fas fa-lightbulb"></i></div>
                    <div class="value-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="145" data-text="112">Design Excellence</div>
                    <div class="value-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="146" data-text="113">Every fixture is meticulously designed to balance aesthetic beauty with optimal functionality, creating pieces that stand the test of time.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="value-item">
                    <div class="value-icon"><i class="fas fa-hand-sparkles"></i></div>
                    <div class="value-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="147" data-text="114">Artisan Craftsmanship</div>
                    <div class="value-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="148" data-text="115">Each piece is crafted by skilled artisans who pour their expertise and passion into every detail, ensuring unparalleled quality.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="value-item">
                    <div class="value-icon"><i class="fas fa-leaf"></i></div>
                    <div class="value-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="149" data-text="116">Sustainable Innovation</div>
                    <div class="value-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="150" data-text="117">We're committed to eco-friendly practices, using energy-efficient LEDs and sustainable materials without compromising on beauty.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mission-statement">
                <h3 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="151" data-text="118">Our Mission</h3>
                <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="152" data-text="119">To create lighting that enhances the way people live, work, and connect with their spaces—delivering warmth, inspiration, and timeless elegance through thoughtful design and exceptional craftsmanship.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Craftsmanship Section -->
        <div class="craftsmanship editable-section" data-section="153">
            <h2 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="154" data-text="120">The Art of Light</h2>
            <div class="craftsmanship-content">
                <div class="craftsmanship-text">
                    <h3 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="155" data-text="121">Where Art Meets Engineering</h3>
                    <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="156" data-text="122">Every LUMINA fixture begins as a sketch, a vision of how light should dance and interact with space. Our designers collaborate with engineers to push the boundaries of what's possible, creating fixtures that are as technically advanced as they are beautiful.</p>
                    <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="157" data-text="123">From hand-blown glass to precision-machined metal components, each element is carefully selected and crafted. Our artisans spend hours perfecting each piece, ensuring that every LUMINA fixture meets our exacting standards of quality and beauty.</p>
                    <div class="craftsmanship-stats">
                        <div class="stat-item">
                            <div class="stat-number editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="158" data-text="124">50+</div>
                            <div class="stat-label editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="159" data-text="125">Quality Checks</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="stat-item">
                            <div class="stat-number editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="160" data-text="126">100%</div>
                            <div class="stat-label editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="161" data-text="127">LED Efficient</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="stat-item">
                            <div class="stat-number editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="162" data-text="128">25+</div>
                            <div class="stat-label editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="163" data-text="129">Years Lifespan</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="craftsmanship-image" style="background-image: url('https://images.pexels.com/photos/4198037/pexels-photo-4198037.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800')"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Our Story Timeline -->
        <div class="story-timeline editable-section" data-section="164">
            <h2 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="165" data-text="130">Our Journey</h2>
            <div class="timeline">
                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <div class="timeline-year editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="166" data-text="131">2010</div>
                        <div class="timeline-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="167" data-text="132">The Beginning</div>
                        <div class="timeline-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="168" data-text="133">Elena Vasquez founds LUMINA in her Brooklyn studio, creating the first collection of handcrafted pendant lights.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <div class="timeline-year editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="169" data-text="134">2014</div>
                        <div class="timeline-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="170" data-text="135">First Showroom</div>
                        <div class="timeline-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="171" data-text="136">We open our flagship showroom in Manhattan, showcasing our growing collection to architects and designers.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <div class="timeline-year editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="172" data-text="137">2018</div>
                        <div class="timeline-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="173" data-text="138">Sustainable Commitment</div>
                        <div class="timeline-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="174" data-text="139">LUMINA pledges to use 100% recyclable packaging and energy-efficient LEDs across all collections.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <div class="timeline-year editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="175" data-text="140">2022</div>
                        <div class="timeline-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="176" data-text="141">Global Expansion</div>
                        <div class="timeline-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="177" data-text="142">Our fixtures illuminate spaces in over 30 countries, from private residences to world-class hotels.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <div class="timeline-year editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="178" data-text="143">2024</div>
                        <div class="timeline-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="179" data-text="144">New Chapter</div>
                        <div class="timeline-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="180" data-text="145">Launch of our smart lighting collection and expansion into sustainable material innovation.</div>
